This product includes the compiled seal kernel evaluator (seal-gateway/wasm/seal.js,
seal-gateway/wasm/seal.wasm, and a byte-identical copy under pwa/wasm/) — a
black-box WebAssembly build of the verified seal mediation kernel (sha256
0b5e792500592b56847f70b1e27e47aecdc65023c7c59fd79695102c465f26ec). The kernel's
decision logic is the subject of public Lean 4 proofs. The compiled artifact is
redistributed here as an opaque verified binary; its source build pipeline is not
included in this repository.

